1 for the musical comedy film \\\"The Muppets\\\".\" That's title \"The Muppets (soundtrack)\", sentence_id 0.\n\nThus JSON answer."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1626,"completion_tokens":523,"total_tokens":2149,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791981915,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}